{"segs": ["PA_ja_55:0.1"], "en": "Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_55:0.2", "PA_ja_55:0.3"], "en": "The First Book, The Chapter on Aspiration (Āsīsavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_55:0.4"], "en": "5. The Pañcāvudha Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_55:1.1", "PA_ja_55:1.2"], "en": "“The man who, with an unflagging mind, acts with an unflagging spirit;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_55:1.3", "PA_ja_55:1.4"], "en": "One develops wholesome states for the attainment of security from bondage;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_55:1.5"], "en": "one shall reach it by gradual stages.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_55:1.6"], "en": "\"The destruction of all fetters.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_55:2.1"], "en": "Thus ends the fifth Jātaka, the Pañcāvudha-jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
